PROJECT.md

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Personal study artifacts: post-mortems and review blocks built from real
# past papers I sat. These quote paper content verbatim, so they stay local.
worksheets/

# Per-student progress and session state — never publishable.
state/
*.session_secret

# The variant retriever is deliberately held back until after the TMUA sitting.
